{
  "id": "publish-post-retry",
  "title": "Publish post · retrying the upload",
  "blurb": "publishPost reads a draft, renders it to HTML, and uploads it to S3, retrying the upload once on failure. A bad-markdown render is caught and falls back to a plain-text upload.",
